launch-status-page

Reads data/state.txt and draws the board: block states, pressures, the clock. Runs on the pad
network only, no auth, no database.

  php -S 0.0.0.0:8080

state.txt is rewritten by the sequencer every second, one key=value per line. The page re-reads it
on every request and never caches. If the file is older than five seconds the header goes red and
says STALE.

Keys

  clock        T-minus or T-plus, seconds
  block.<n>    one of idle, armed, live, fault
  press.<n>    bar
  note         free text, shown as is

Layout

  index.php        request handling, staleness check
  lib/state.php    parse and validate state.txt
  lib/render.php   html for the board
  templates/       header, block row, footer
  doc/state.txt    key list and allowed values
- usage
- keys
- layout
- pad network only
